This directory contains fuzzing harnesses for use with clang's libfuzzer.

HPN-SSH-specific harnesses (not present upstream):
  sftp_bundle_extract_fuzz   — server-side tar reader for the
                               hpn-bundle-open@hpnssh.org extension
                               (exercises bundle_path_is_safe + libarchive
                               tar parsing).
  sftp_fs_info_fuzz          — client-side reply parser for the
                               hpn-fs-info@hpnssh.org extension
                               (sshbuf cstring + u64 + u32 + u64 sequence).
